WEBVTT

00:05.700 --> 00:10.460
In the great tower,
what is it that is valued most of all?

00:31.090 --> 00:34.220
It is, of course, magical ability.

00:45.660 --> 00:48.420
Do those without true ability...

00:49.320 --> 00:53.700
have any hope of aspiring to reach
the pinnacle of magic?

01:05.970 --> 01:07.760
The answer to that...

01:13.330 --> 01:17.170
Together with everyone else,
I will keep moving forward!

01:30.550 --> 01:34.320
Elfie, I promise I will reach you.

01:51.010 --> 01:55.720
Episode 13
Barrier Day

03:06.460 --> 03:08.920
Rigarden Magical Academy

03:08.920 --> 03:10.550
The Day Before the Final Day of Graduation Exams
Rigarden Magical Academy, Faculty Room

03:08.920 --> 03:10.550
A perfect score in every subject?!

03:11.000 --> 03:14.050
Yes, I've checked them multiple times.
There's no mistake.

03:14.050 --> 03:15.500
It's Will Serfort!

03:15.930 --> 03:18.310
We're still grading,
but he hasn't made a single error.

03:18.310 --> 03:21.130
Even Lihanna's missed her chance
at a perfect run.

03:21.130 --> 03:23.190
He might just do it!

03:23.440 --> 03:24.940
The book-learner could pass!

03:24.940 --> 03:27.440
Fully clearing on writing and praxis!

03:27.440 --> 03:29.360
He's not even a bad student.
He's a <i>no-talent!</i>

03:27.900 --> 03:31.610
Rigarden Magical Academy Professor
Edward Serfence

03:29.360 --> 03:31.740
And he may make an unprecedented
ascent to the tower!

03:35.700 --> 03:38.080
Written Magizoology
Will Serfort: Perfect Score

03:38.490 --> 03:41.000
Rigarden Magical Academy Professor
Workner Norgram

03:39.680 --> 03:41.000
Yes!

03:42.410 --> 03:44.670
That's wonderful, Workner.

03:44.750 --> 03:48.580
Rigarden Magical Academy Professor
Eliza Nosferat

03:45.150 --> 03:48.670
It seems the student you took under your
wing is about to have his dream come true.

03:48.670 --> 03:50.560
Professor Eliza.

03:50.560 --> 03:52.640
He still has one more exam to go.

03:52.640 --> 03:55.660
You never know what may
happen before the end!

03:55.660 --> 03:58.450
And? Where is this book-learner
everyone is talking about?

03:59.310 --> 04:00.930
He is, of course...

04:02.140 --> 04:05.520
Rigarden Magical Academy
Study Room

04:07.130 --> 04:09.020
Will, are you all right?

04:09.280 --> 04:11.630
You didn't sleep much
last night either, did you?

04:11.630 --> 04:13.060
I'm fine.

04:13.060 --> 04:14.530
I mean, I'm not.

04:14.610 --> 04:18.660
Familiar
Kiki

04:14.610 --> 04:18.660
Rigarden Magical Academy, Sixth Year
Will Serfort

04:14.870 --> 04:17.820
But the last written exam is tomorrow.

04:19.860 --> 04:22.910
Still... since they postponed praxis,

04:20.490 --> 04:25.460
Rigarden Magical Academy, Sixth Year
Colette Loire

04:22.910 --> 04:25.790
that's also been happening
on top of our final exams.

04:26.420 --> 04:29.550
You only just defeated
that Naberous yesterday.

04:29.550 --> 04:30.710
Yeah.

04:30.710 --> 04:34.050
Thanks to Lihanna and the others,
I was able to get all my praxis credits.

04:34.770 --> 04:37.800
I can't let everyone's
kindness go to waste.

04:37.800 --> 04:40.180
That's not what I'm worried about.

04:40.180 --> 04:43.620
You've only received a handful
of spellwork credits, right?

04:40.220 --> 04:44.810
Rigarden Magical Academy, Sixth Year
Rosty Nowman

04:43.620 --> 04:45.060
That's right, Rosty.

04:45.580 --> 04:48.550
Just the five from my lesson
with Professor Edward.

04:49.060 --> 04:51.470
The remaining tests are worth six credits.

04:51.470 --> 04:54.270
If I can get just one more,
I'll be able to ascend to the tower.

04:54.270 --> 04:55.530
I can't let my guard down now!

04:55.950 --> 04:59.000
But if you work too hard...

05:00.490 --> 05:01.300
Ow!

05:01.300 --> 05:02.150
See?

05:02.150 --> 05:03.750
You've got so many gray hairs!

05:03.750 --> 05:05.530
What do you think you're doing?!

05:05.530 --> 05:07.640
What do you mean? I'm plucking gray hairs!

05:07.640 --> 05:10.000
I always do that for him.

05:10.000 --> 05:13.090
Oh! Miss Colette,
did you want to do it instead?

05:13.090 --> 05:15.620
I-I would never...

05:15.620 --> 05:16.970
I would never...

05:16.970 --> 05:18.510
Never what?

05:21.010 --> 05:25.940
Rigarden Magical Academy
Headmistress's Office

05:21.090 --> 05:25.890
It's very impressive you defeated a
floor keeper amidst your busy schedules.

05:25.890 --> 05:28.040
Truly magnificent work.

05:29.400 --> 05:33.030
I merely got caught up in things,
Headmistress Caldron.

05:33.340 --> 05:37.630
Even without defeating that Naberous,
I'd still be able to ascend to the tower!

05:34.320 --> 05:39.200
Rigarden Magical Academy
Julius Reinberg

05:37.630 --> 05:41.160
And yet Colette and the others
dragged me into it...

05:41.160 --> 05:44.410
It's true we would've been
just fine without you.

05:42.160 --> 05:47.040
Rigarden Magical Academy
Sion Ulster

05:44.410 --> 05:46.950
That ice that you're so
proud of kept melting.

05:46.950 --> 05:48.870
It wasn't much help at all.

05:49.430 --> 05:50.870
What did you just say?!

05:50.870 --> 05:53.030
You hid in the shadow of that no-talent!

05:53.030 --> 05:55.110
All you did was pathetically
play with fire!

05:55.110 --> 05:59.260
Don't insult the flames of Ulster!
You blasted show-off of a Reinberg!

06:01.640 --> 06:06.060
Rigarden Magical Academy Headmistress
Caldron Anouve

06:02.490 --> 06:06.270
It sounds that the two of you just can't
stand to leave Will alone, can you?

06:06.270 --> 06:07.670
Who can't?!

06:08.390 --> 06:13.320
Rigarden Magical Academy
Breezeway

06:09.170 --> 06:13.800
With this, both we and Sion's group
have completed all our praxis credits.

06:13.800 --> 06:17.750
Yes. When you have the proven
ability to defeat a floor keeper,

06:17.750 --> 06:19.530
you can show off just a bit to the tower.

06:19.570 --> 06:24.580
Rigarden Magical Academy, Sixth Year
Wignall Lindor

06:19.570 --> 06:24.580
Rigarden Magical Academy, Sixth Year
Lihanna Owenzaus

06:19.990 --> 06:24.550
Though, after defeating a Grand Duke,
that all felt a little anticlimactic, no?

06:25.320 --> 06:26.410
You're not wrong.

06:29.010 --> 06:30.650
You've changed, Lihanna.

06:31.130 --> 06:34.350
Now, you're a touch softer
than you were before.

06:34.670 --> 06:38.390
You say that, but you look as if your
sharp edges have melted away to me.

06:38.390 --> 06:41.680
In the past, you always
wore an unruffled smile,

06:41.930 --> 06:45.280
yet the truth is that you were
feeling the most pressure of all.

06:47.430 --> 06:50.690
Indeed. I'm sure I have him to thank.

06:51.480 --> 06:53.610
It's all right to fail
as many times as it takes.

06:53.610 --> 06:55.940
That's what he taught me
through that adventure.

06:56.400 --> 06:57.940
I learned things, too.

06:58.640 --> 07:01.320
My sense of inferiority
and my cowardly heart...

07:01.820 --> 07:04.870
I learned they could be transformed
into that magic called courage.

07:06.700 --> 07:09.570
I wonder what he's doing right now.

07:10.250 --> 07:11.890
That's obvious.

07:12.880 --> 07:14.900
This is the final push.

07:14.900 --> 07:19.050
And Will is a hard enough worker
that even an elf recognizes his efforts.

07:21.290 --> 07:22.990
It's this late and he's still at it?

07:22.990 --> 07:25.630
I just know he's overworking himself.

07:25.900 --> 07:28.640
Will, I brought you a late-night snack!

07:28.640 --> 07:31.430
I talked to Professor Workner,
and he gave me special...

07:47.570 --> 07:48.570
Will?

07:50.620 --> 07:51.830
Are you asleep?

08:06.010 --> 08:08.840
What might you be doing, Miss Colette?

08:12.470 --> 08:14.390
H-How long have you been there?

08:14.390 --> 08:15.850
No, wait! You got it all wrong!

08:15.850 --> 08:19.440
I-I was worried about Will,
so I was just putting a cloak over him!

08:19.440 --> 08:21.230
Oh, is that what that was?

08:21.230 --> 08:25.150
It looked to me as if
you were going to kiss him!

08:25.150 --> 08:26.820
I'm sorry I got the wrong idea.

08:31.240 --> 08:33.450
It's true that I'm worried about him.

08:34.120 --> 08:37.960
Will is all worn out,
but he still pushes himself so hard.

08:38.330 --> 08:39.960
He's constantly battered and bruised.

08:42.380 --> 08:46.000
I hate the Magia Vander.

08:47.880 --> 08:50.760
Because of the spell Albis Vina cast,

08:50.760 --> 08:53.010
Will is always chasing after her.

08:53.010 --> 08:58.020
Yet she doesn't do a thing. She's merely
waiting in the tower, and that's just...

08:59.350 --> 09:01.020
I feel so sorry for Will.

09:03.310 --> 09:04.770
That's true.

09:07.320 --> 09:09.070
I feel the same way.

09:13.160 --> 09:16.660
Elfaria Albis Serfort

09:16.740 --> 09:19.290
Ice Faction Aide-de-Camp
Sarissa Alfeld

09:19.790 --> 09:22.790
Lady Elfaria, is something wrong?

09:24.170 --> 09:25.040
No.

09:26.960 --> 09:30.220
Well, this is rare, Idleness Incarnate.

09:30.970 --> 09:33.680
For a recluse like you to come out...

09:33.680 --> 09:36.850
Will it rain spears of hail tomorrow?

09:33.720 --> 09:37.180
Ellenor Ljos Alf

09:37.180 --> 09:38.640
Ellenor.

09:39.100 --> 09:43.440
Was it really that distressing to lose
to me in the magic competition?

09:43.440 --> 09:46.020
That's only because
it was restricted to ice magic!

09:46.020 --> 09:48.570
If I'd been allowed to use other magic,
I'd have crushed you!

09:49.150 --> 09:52.400
I was wondering what
the racket was. It's you two.

09:53.610 --> 09:55.700
This is my path.

09:55.740 --> 09:58.580
Zeo Thorzeus Reinbolt

09:57.160 --> 09:58.580
Get out of my way.

09:58.580 --> 10:00.370
You're the one who should leave, please...

09:58.580 --> 10:00.370
<i>You</i> get out of <i>my</i> way...

10:00.370 --> 10:01.200
Barbarian.

10:02.410 --> 10:05.960
Haven't you looked in the mirror,
you brazen harridans?

10:07.040 --> 10:08.710
Both you and Ellenor...

10:09.300 --> 10:10.880
What are you doing here?

10:10.880 --> 10:12.970
Don't ask.

10:13.470 --> 10:15.720
Same story for you two, right?

10:16.090 --> 10:17.430
It's Terminalia.

10:17.800 --> 10:21.140
I have to get ready
for that annoying ritual.

10:21.140 --> 10:23.350
The barrier is about to disappear.

10:23.350 --> 10:25.020
It's the end of a year.

10:25.480 --> 10:29.820
How useful will the next lot
to appear be? It's worth watching.

10:32.070 --> 10:33.740
History of Magic Final Exam

10:38.370 --> 10:42.120
I never imagined that Professor Edward
would be in charge of the last day.

10:42.120 --> 10:45.710
Having that snake's tests
for three periods is the worst.

10:45.710 --> 10:47.880
I might not make it to the tower.

10:49.090 --> 10:50.500
Silence.

10:52.840 --> 10:55.380
We will now begin your final exam.

10:55.930 --> 10:58.640
But before that, let me tell you...

10:59.050 --> 11:02.140
I will only be putting to you
a single question.

11:02.140 --> 11:06.400
Everyone who can answer said question
will be awarded all six credits.

11:08.900 --> 11:11.400
I will not be taking any questions.

11:11.650 --> 11:15.610
Show me what you have cultivated
in your six years here at the academy.

11:20.120 --> 11:21.410
And now...

11:21.410 --> 11:22.410
Begin!

11:23.370 --> 11:24.790
What is magic?

11:26.710 --> 11:29.250
With your own magical affinity
as the foundation,

11:29.250 --> 11:31.710
explain using the following terms:

11:32.050 --> 11:35.050
tela, connection, manifestation.

11:35.420 --> 11:39.550
This is about describing the activation of
and prerequisites for magic!

11:40.140 --> 11:44.310
It's a process that we usually
conduct unconsciously.

11:44.600 --> 11:47.940
He's asking us to explain that
sensation by putting it into words.

11:47.940 --> 11:50.560
Articulating it is difficult, but...

11:50.560 --> 11:52.570
If that's all, I might
be able to answer this!

11:52.570 --> 11:56.570
Indeed, if you're a mage or an elf,
you'll be able to produce an answer.

11:56.570 --> 11:59.700
But no one else could.

11:59.700 --> 12:02.620
So then... what about him?

12:06.040 --> 12:08.620
It's no use. I can't answer this.

12:09.250 --> 12:11.630
My knowledge is pointless.

12:11.630 --> 12:15.340
This isn't in any textbook.
It cannot be taught.

12:15.340 --> 12:18.220
Your sense for it...
Your talent is everything.

12:18.680 --> 12:22.600
I can't use magic, so I have
no business answering this!

12:23.350 --> 12:25.390
I can't solve this myself!

12:25.390 --> 12:27.600
Does that mean it's over?
I won't reach the tower?

12:28.440 --> 12:30.100
What about my promise to Elfie?

12:31.690 --> 12:33.190
Don't give up!

12:35.610 --> 12:37.570
For me, magic is...

12:38.280 --> 12:39.360
aspiration!

12:40.410 --> 12:42.910
It's a miracle I can't grasp
no matter how far I stretch!

12:44.410 --> 12:46.240
It's so beautiful...

12:46.240 --> 12:47.870
and so cruel!

12:50.040 --> 12:52.290
Magic is what lies at the end
of all our hard work.

12:52.630 --> 12:54.380
If you refuse to ever give up,

12:54.380 --> 12:57.340
I believe there's a power
that can surpass even magic!

12:57.340 --> 13:00.720
I... To me, magic is...

13:05.810 --> 13:06.930
Ed!

13:06.930 --> 13:08.680
What was that exam?!

13:08.680 --> 13:10.270
What was that question?!

13:10.270 --> 13:11.690
Whatever do you mean?

13:11.980 --> 13:13.770
I merely asked our tower hopefuls

13:13.770 --> 13:17.780
about the most important
foundation for a mage.

13:17.780 --> 13:20.360
Roughly 40 percent
of the students got it wrong.

13:21.200 --> 13:23.570
How exasperatingly deplorable.

13:23.570 --> 13:26.330
That's not what I'm asking you!

13:26.330 --> 13:29.200
That question was directed
at one specific student!

13:29.200 --> 13:32.460
How could you do something
so wrong as a teacher?!

13:34.290 --> 13:36.550
You're the ones in the wrong!

13:40.340 --> 13:43.680
What are you playing at, letting someone
who can't use magic into the tower?

13:44.010 --> 13:46.680
What could he possibly do
in the Wand Graveyard?

13:46.680 --> 13:48.850
Do you intend for him
to be a test subject?

13:49.180 --> 13:51.690
You fool. This isn't a joke.

13:51.940 --> 13:55.810
In our world of magic,
a sword cannot become a wand!

13:56.820 --> 14:01.070
You've lost your minds.
Both you and the headmistress.

14:02.950 --> 14:06.030
Nipping a dream
that can never come true...

14:03.070 --> 14:07.740
The List of Failed Students

14:06.030 --> 14:09.870
That is the greatest
kindness I can show him.

14:08.030 --> 14:11.200
Will Serfort

14:12.250 --> 14:13.960
Will Serfort...

14:14.250 --> 14:17.460
Earned credits: 7,199.

14:18.210 --> 14:20.210
Disqualified from the tower.

14:24.680 --> 14:27.970
Rigarden
Officially Urbus Rigarden, the capital of magic. It is the capital city of the Rhizanth,
the inhabitants of paradise. A great metropolis that stands at the center of the world of magic.
Mercedes Caulis, the Wizard's Tower, welcomes the five most powerful wizards, the Magia Vander.
Rigarden Magical Academy boasts the world's best magic education program.
The Abyss Gate is the first gate leading into the dungeon.
The city's many important facilities bring in talented fledgling mages from all over the world.
The city is also called the Land of Legend, or the Land of Beginning, for driving off the Celestial Host.

14:29.680 --> 14:32.980
Terminalia, The Barrier Festival
Do not ever leave this undone. It must always be built.
Whatever it may take, send the barrier to the edge of the sky.
That is why the Magia Vander exist.
-The words of a certain mage queen.

14:36.650 --> 14:37.480
Will.

14:37.940 --> 14:40.280
I've finished repairing your goggles.

14:40.820 --> 14:42.240
I left them in our room.

14:44.110 --> 14:45.110
Will...

14:45.490 --> 14:46.870
Rosty.

14:47.620 --> 14:50.410
Professor Edward is really mean.

14:50.410 --> 14:52.040
That question...

14:52.040 --> 14:54.330
There's no way someone
like me could answer it.

14:55.290 --> 14:58.040
A question like that was just mean.

14:59.540 --> 15:02.760
This can't be happening...
You've gotta be kidding me!

15:05.300 --> 15:06.380
I'm sorry...

15:06.930 --> 15:08.760
I'm sorry, Elfie!

15:11.510 --> 15:15.690
The way you are right now, I don't
think anything I say will reach you.

15:16.520 --> 15:17.770
But I'll say it anyway.

15:18.810 --> 15:21.230
I am always here with you.

15:26.910 --> 15:28.070
Lihanna!

15:28.530 --> 15:29.780
Did you find Will?

15:29.780 --> 15:32.200
No, he isn't anywhere.

15:32.200 --> 15:34.370
Wignall and I searched together, but...

15:35.040 --> 15:37.540
At the very least, he isn't in the dorm.

15:37.540 --> 15:39.540
He's likely left the academy grounds.

15:39.830 --> 15:40.840
Will...

15:40.840 --> 15:42.550
Where have you gone?

15:43.000 --> 15:47.630
A student who can't ascend to the tower
disappears from campus, heartbroken.

15:48.050 --> 15:50.550
It's a common occurrence
this time of year, isn't it?

15:50.550 --> 15:51.390
Julius!

15:52.220 --> 15:57.140
Being forced to look for a no-talent
is a major nuisance, you know?

15:58.020 --> 16:00.270
A disgrace of a man who's up and run off?

16:00.270 --> 16:02.150
Don't bother with someone like that.

16:02.980 --> 16:04.650
Take that back.

16:04.650 --> 16:06.950
Do not insult the friend of an elf.

16:06.950 --> 16:11.530
Sounds like he chained you up good
in the dungeon, didn't he, my lord elf?

16:11.530 --> 16:14.660
Or maybe it's just that you've
been corrupted by him.

16:14.660 --> 16:15.830
What did you say?

16:18.500 --> 16:22.340
In this magic academy, in this world...

16:22.340 --> 16:24.170
magic is everything!

16:24.800 --> 16:29.260
No matter how capable he may be in the
dungeon, a sword does not belong here!

16:31.050 --> 16:33.560
What is it, Sion?
What's that look in your eyes?

16:34.010 --> 16:38.730
Like me, you've always seen
that no-talent as an enemy, right?

16:39.230 --> 16:45.400
That's true. He really infuriates me,
and I'd planned to defeat him myself.

16:46.030 --> 16:48.150
But the opportunity for that has passed.

16:48.530 --> 16:50.780
And I can't stand it. That's all.

16:52.070 --> 16:54.370
What are you kids up to?

16:54.370 --> 16:55.870
Professor Workner!

16:56.290 --> 16:59.080
We've been looking for Will,

16:59.080 --> 17:00.790
but we can't find him anywhere!

17:02.960 --> 17:04.790
I'll look for Will.

17:05.460 --> 17:07.210
All of you should go.

17:07.210 --> 17:08.300
B-But...

17:08.920 --> 17:11.010
It's the last night of the year.

17:11.010 --> 17:12.430
It's Terminalia.

17:13.090 --> 17:15.390
You are all to let loose
and enjoy yourselves.

17:19.180 --> 17:21.350
Festival time!

17:22.690 --> 17:25.480
Welcome to New Year's Eve!

17:25.480 --> 17:27.940
I hope everyone's doing well
all around the world!

17:27.940 --> 17:30.950
Urbus Rigarden will once again be holding

17:30.950 --> 17:36.200
the annual greatest of festivals
and greatest of rituals!

17:36.660 --> 17:40.870
This year, your announcer
will be yours truly!

17:39.370 --> 17:44.250
Clairie Serah

17:40.870 --> 17:46.210
I'm a tower high mage, 26 years old,
and single! That's me, Clairie Serah!

17:46.210 --> 17:51.340
It's the end of the year, and yet today
I'm still working, working, working!

17:51.590 --> 17:53.840
Seeing those happy families down there...

17:53.840 --> 17:56.470
The gap between us makes me want to cry.

17:56.470 --> 17:57.850
Even if I invite my peers out,

17:57.850 --> 18:00.980
they always end up telling me
their students are more important.

18:00.980 --> 18:02.810
Fine pieces of work, am I right?

18:04.730 --> 18:08.230
Hey! Are you listening? Workner! Ed!

18:08.230 --> 18:11.650
When <i>we</i> were students,
the three of us were always together!

18:11.650 --> 18:12.990
You'd better remember this!

18:12.990 --> 18:15.240
It could be me up there one day.

18:15.240 --> 18:18.490
Ahem! Pardon me. I lost my composure.

18:18.490 --> 18:21.540
Before any more of my silliness
is broadcast to the whole world,

18:21.540 --> 18:24.580
I bring you the magnificent
sight laid out before me!

18:25.000 --> 18:28.210
That's right! Tonight is Terminalia!

18:28.210 --> 18:33.510
And we're undertaking the reconstruction
of the Great Barrier protecting the sky!

18:43.310 --> 18:44.770
Long, long ago...

18:46.480 --> 18:51.650
people did not know of the sky.
This world was locked in darkness.

18:52.190 --> 18:56.360
The Celestial Host
destroyed the wide, vast earth,

18:56.360 --> 18:59.240
and a great number of lives
became a funeral procession.

19:00.490 --> 19:05.580
Just when all seemed lost,
right at that moment...

19:06.330 --> 19:08.330
Under our founder, Mercedes,

19:08.330 --> 19:13.420
five great mages sealed off the sky
and forced the Host to retreat!

19:13.420 --> 19:16.760
That was five hundred years ago today!

19:16.760 --> 19:21.510
The Magia Vanders' Great Barrier was cast
to serve as our sky to this very day,

19:21.510 --> 19:24.060
and it has continued to protect us!

19:26.690 --> 19:29.690
The barrier is effective
for one year's time.

19:29.690 --> 19:34.360
Every year, at its close, a new
Great Barrier is erected to shroud us.

19:35.320 --> 19:39.240
The dissolving of the Great Barrier
would mean our legends becoming reality.

19:35.570 --> 19:40.370
The Wizard's Tower Watcher
Iris Churchill

19:39.700 --> 19:41.700
There can be no mistakes.

19:41.700 --> 19:44.200
Nothing unusual on the ground.
How's the sky?

19:41.780 --> 19:44.200
Fire Faction
Rodge Holland

19:44.200 --> 19:46.040
No abnormalities in the air either.

19:46.040 --> 19:48.830
No suspicious shadows
or reactions to magic seen.

19:49.250 --> 19:51.210
Every situation is all clear.

19:51.210 --> 19:52.960
Preparations are complete...

19:52.960 --> 19:54.340
Lord Logwell.

19:59.180 --> 20:02.180
It is time, Lord Cariot.

20:02.180 --> 20:03.680
I know.

20:04.060 --> 20:07.440
Let us begin the barrier celebration.

20:08.020 --> 20:09.730
Now, everyone!

20:09.730 --> 20:12.520
Please welcome them with a song of glory!

20:12.520 --> 20:14.900
The Magia Vander have arrived!

20:15.440 --> 20:16.990
The Great Light Sovereign!

20:16.990 --> 20:18.570
Lord Aaron!

20:17.280 --> 20:18.450
Lord Cariot!

20:18.240 --> 20:20.410
My bro, Zeo!

20:18.740 --> 20:21.450
Huzzah for Lady Ellenor!

20:19.610 --> 20:21.070
Lady Elfaria!

20:21.450 --> 20:24.790
Right now, I'm sure some of you
must be sunk in despondency.

20:24.790 --> 20:27.540
And I'm sure there must
be some trapped in despair.

20:27.960 --> 20:30.460
But please, lift your heads!

20:31.420 --> 20:32.500
Elfie...

20:33.800 --> 20:36.300
We must never forget.

20:36.300 --> 20:40.840
Even now, the Celestial Host
still targets our world!

20:40.840 --> 20:44.850
This paradise is under threat even now!

20:45.350 --> 20:48.850
No matter how down you may feel,
we must uplift the sky!

20:48.850 --> 20:51.060
We must drive back the wickedness!

20:51.770 --> 20:54.480
Now, raise your lights high.

20:54.940 --> 20:58.610
We, too, must once again
help to support the sky!

21:04.240 --> 21:05.990
Begin!

21:05.990 --> 21:07.660
Flame Crown!

21:08.620 --> 21:10.210
Water Orb.

21:10.920 --> 21:12.630
Lightning Throne.

21:12.960 --> 21:14.630
Wind Scepter.

21:14.630 --> 21:18.130
I offer the Earth Altar!

21:18.420 --> 21:21.470
Open, o primordial darkness.

21:21.470 --> 21:26.640
Then light will become a boundary
that is the enemy of the celestial.

21:29.730 --> 21:35.650
Vandes Terminalia
Supreme Spell: The Five Wands' Great Barrier Partitioning Paradise

21:30.600 --> 21:32.400
Supreme Spell...

21:33.100 --> 21:35.900
Vendes Terminalia!

21:36.400 --> 21:41.200
Five, four, three, two, one!

21:43.280 --> 21:45.990
Happy New Year!

21:48.750 --> 21:51.540
Farewell to yesteryear!

21:51.540 --> 21:54.290
And welcome to the new one!

21:54.290 --> 21:57.300
May Mercedes's blessing be with you!

21:57.960 --> 21:59.590
Congratulations, Rigarden!

21:59.590 --> 22:02.430
Welcome to a whole new world!

22:13.310 --> 22:15.980
Happy New Year!

22:17.820 --> 22:20.320
What was that? A prank?

22:20.320 --> 22:21.440
How scary.

22:21.440 --> 22:22.820
Is it a festival performance?

22:23.110 --> 22:25.780
No, there wasn't anything
like this last year.

22:26.570 --> 22:28.910
What are those magic circles?

22:28.910 --> 22:30.660
Hurry up and pin down the cause!

22:33.790 --> 22:36.750
Mama, what are those?

23:01.860 --> 23:06.530
By activating the Great Barrier,
the Magia Vander used up all their magic.

23:06.530 --> 23:08.280
They're out of commission for a while.

23:09.240 --> 23:11.540
Now then, it's time.

23:22.510 --> 23:24.720
Let the party from hell begin.

23:36.520 --> 23:39.270
Next time on <i>Wistoria: Wand and Sword</i>,

23:39.600 --> 23:42.610
episode 14, " The Party from Hell Begins."

23:40.940 --> 23:45.950
Episode 14
The Party from Hell Begins
